    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e7430995b418996160c94c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "刚才爱丽速子奔跑的身影，在我脑中挥之不去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a42a33260a7c1e9530f378e3898575c661bd84fa8f1b79ff7e4e32c80209d5b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70cdc6f93ff2ee883dbe68c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而她说『可能性的尽头在那遥不可及的远方』。\r\n也就是说爱丽速子――她的速度还能更快。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56cadbfa3c08ef85520d71c9a8084669704377517fa2fde6a4170c89e0ff5cd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b336a2ee454a86ab8c8300a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我也想见证……那未来……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a7515fbb2013b71bbefa27f120bbeb9531d597dfd4ed4ae2eea1adf8770ca7b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
