    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fba9e2036200c95da4e67412",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "难不成，你打算『邀请』我吗？\r\n喂喂饶了我吧，我可不想把研究再推迟下去了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "564791d3d282eb68533f0e1f2324281cbbd14258a303f7f43b18a22386aaa057",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37018acecbfa2e9bd45b34a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子并不寻求什么正经的训练员。\r\n日常的训练对她来说也只不过是研究的一环。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8056c8abc9396b0ac0c83392ed0e0457a4d08c443eeda9cd76cba348daa61998",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032004.json",
      "json_path": [
