    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef150db385f5faf6cf72ea08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我意外地成为了这两位强者对决的目击者，\r\n她们从起跑开始就释放出令人全身麻痹的强烈压迫感……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e83049432a609336622b1b11803e974de577761381d916da09412bdc7c3f4d82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1032/storytimeline_041032004.json",
